Suppose:

```jsx
function App() {
  const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState(2);

  return <List selectedId={selectedId} />;
}
```

And `List` passes it to `Row`:

```jsx
<List selectedId={selectedId} />

<Row selected={selectedId === 2} />
```

Where did `Row` get its `selected` value?
